  "heading": "A \\:(proper)::subset:/ B",
  "heading_latex": "\\htmlData{mlg-ref=5c3a7375627365743a2f}{A\\textrm{ is a subset of }B}\\textrm{ }\\left(\\textrm{proper}\\right)",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[A \\:(proper)::subset:/ B]\nRefines: A\nwhen: B is \\set\nspecifies: A \\:subset:/ B\nsatisfies: A != B\nDocumented:\n. adjective: \"proper\"\n. written: \"A? \\subsetneq B?\"\n. description: \"$A \\subsetneq B$ holds when $A$ is a subset of $B$ but is not\n                equal to $B$; that is, $B$ has at least one element not in $A$.\"\nId: \"7d070f37-61a5-4c62-b8da-4831c222e4b2\"",
